    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n49721" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἴᾱσις</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῑ]</span>, 
			Ion.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἴησις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>, ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰάομαι</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>healing, mode
				of healing, remedy</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Aph.</u>
				2.17
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OT</u>
				68
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Smp.</u>
				188c
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἷς [πήμασιν] ἴ. οὐκ ἔνεστ᾽ ἰδεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>El.</u>
					876
				</span></i>
			; [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀδίκημα] οὗ μή ἐστιν
			ἴ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				1374b31
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Antipho
				5.94
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arr.
				<u>An.</u>
				7.29.2
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔλεγχος ἰ. τοῦ λόγου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Metaph.</u>
					1009a21
				</span></i>
			: pl., <i>cures</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰάσεις ἀποτελῶ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Ev.Luc.</u>
					13.32
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>mending, repairs</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζυγάστρου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>SIG</u>
					244i53
				</span></i>
			(Delph., <span class="entity">iv B.C.</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> Alch., <i>cupellation, refining,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PLeid.X.
				21
			</span></i>.</div>
